    tutorialOverview = [[
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
                    OVERVIEW
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

Toy Rotation Hub is a script that automatically collects toys you've spawned in-game and arranges them into rotating geometric formations.

The hub features:
• Two independent rotation systems (run simultaneously)
• 32 unique shape formations
• Giant Hand constructions from ladders
• Simple Hand (Pallet + 5 Ladders)
• Dual Side formations (left & right)
• Barrier Break exploit (Normal + NoTP)
• Sky Color customization (8 presets + sliders)
• Full trilingual support (EN/RU/JP)
• PC and Mobile optimized interface

══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
                   REQUIREMENTS
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

• Any Roblox executor (PC or Mobile)
• Game must have spawnable toys (MenuToys in ReplicatedStorage)
• You MUST spawn toys BEFORE selecting them in the script
• For Barrier Break: Must be OUTSIDE your house/plot area

══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
                  QUICK START GUIDE
══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

1. Execute script — loader appears
2. Select your device (PC or Mobile) — auto-detected
3. Select your language (EN/RU/JP)
4. Click LOAD SCRIPT
5. Main menu opens
6. Spawn toys in-game
7. Go to Rotation 1 → Objects tab → click toy name
8. Go to Rotation 1 → Shapes tab → pick a formation
9. Go to Rotation 1 → Control tab → enable "Rotation ON"
10. Adjust radius, height, speed as needed
11. Repeat for Rotation 2 for a second formation

══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
