FAQ:
Q: Toys aren't rotating! What do I do?
A: 1) Spawn toys first  2) Select correct object  3) Enable
   Rotation ON  4) Try Force Rescan

Q: The formation is too small/big!
A: Adjust the Radius slider in the Control tab (2-40 studs)

Q: Can I use two different toys at once?
